# Redirect old Netlify domains to the canonical custom domain
https://senditsystem.netlify.app/* https://senditsystem.in/:splat 301!
https://senditsystemadmin.netlify.app/* https://senditsystem.in/:splat 301!

# Redirect www to non-www
https://www.senditsystem.in/* https://senditsystem.in/:splat 301!

# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://senditsystem.in/* https://senditsystem.in/:splat 301!

# Redirect the old history route to the registered React route
/code-history /code/history 301!
/code-history/ /code/history 301!

